red in groupoids over a category\n<MATH_0002>. Let <MATH_0003> be a functor.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a morphism of categories cofibered in groupoids\nover <MATH_0005>. Let <MATH_0006> be the groupoid in functors on\n<MATH_0007> constructed from <MATH_0008> in\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nThen there is a natural morphism <MATH_0009> such that:\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0010> is fully faithful.\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0011> is an equivalence if and only if\n<MATH_0012> is essentially surjective.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n<STRUCT_0006>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e32f51919179f309f4231ee181c23202c621ebff91cb8a9c93dabc97e148f7ce", "unit_id": "inventory:formal-defos:06KZ:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "locked-English-neighbor:formal-defos:inventory:formal-defos:06KZ:proof/0001", "hash": "sha256:dd2ba64a70ee22e4e2265fd3922b2164406fd15309882976b9445f7ad4d9f9ec", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 251750, "byte_start": 251716, "file": "formal-defos.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:63d087ac77600f36e5601b58649c13b2efbf62cce0d2cd9c2d514d16f9dcd388", "line_end": 6669, "line_start": 6667}, "owner_tag": "06KZ", "parent_tag": "06KW", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "06KW", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{proof}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{proof}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9603599f1e0b8edf7825b06f19911bb7173f49681b1681a96cca9f0563de4bd4", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nOmitted.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:90dc9403679f48a43af0a4cc4e58334912dcf51d808f9d35d54ab8b378f6957c", "unit_id": "inventory:formal-defos:06KZ:proof/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "locked-English-neighbor:fo